<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Levin Benjamin Joseph</songwriter><songwriter>Ed Sheeran</songwriter><songwriter>Justin Bieber</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">你总是给我泼冷水</text><text for="L2">还用我的名字混进夜店</text><text for="L3">你以为你伤了我的心 哦 女孩 拜托</text><text for="L4">你以为我会独自哭泣 好吧 我才不会</text><text for="L5">我原本不想写这首歌</text><text for="L6">因为我不想让人觉得我还在乎 我早就不在乎了</text><text for="L7">但你还一直给我打电话</text><text for="L8">宝贝 我已经迈步向前</text><text for="L9">我觉得你根本不值得我留恋</text><text for="L10">也许你该知道</text><text for="L11">我妈妈对所有人都很友善 但就是不喜欢你</text><text for="L12">我从来都不喜欢承认是我犯了错</text><text for="L13">我一直沉迷工作</text><text for="L14">忽略了这一切</text><text for="L15">但现在我明白了</text><text for="L16">自己一个人睡得更香</text><text for="L17">如果你这么喜欢自己这副样子</text><text for="L18">哦 宝贝 你真该去爱自己</text><text for="L19">如果你还以为我放不下过去</text><text for="L20">你真该去爱自己</text><text for="L21">你说讨厌我的朋友</text><text for="L22">问题其实出在你身上 而不是他们</text><text for="L23">每次你都否定我的意见</text><text for="L24">想让我忘记自己是谁</text><text for="L25">我原本不想写这首歌</text><text for="L26">因为我不想让人觉得我还在乎 我早就不在乎了</text><text for="L27">但你还一直给我打电话</text><text for="L28">宝贝 我已经迈步向前</text><text for="L29">我觉得你根本不值得我留恋</text><text for="L30">也许你该知道</text><text for="L31">我妈妈对所有人都很友善 但就是不喜欢你</text><text for="L32">我从来都不喜欢承认是我犯了错</text><text for="L33">我一直沉迷工作</text><text for="L34">忽略了这一切</text><text for="L35">但现在我明白了</text><text for="L36">自己一个人睡得更香</text><text for="L37">如果你这么喜欢自己这副样子</text><text for="L38">哦 宝贝 你真该去爱自己</text><text for="L39">如果你还以为我放不下过去</text><text for="L40">你真该去爱自己</text><text for="L41">那些让我觉得卑微的日子</text><text for="L42">我曾爱过你 如今却什么感觉也没有了</text><text for="L43">我从未在自己脆弱时 感到如此低落</text><text for="L44">我是不是太傻 竟然让你摧毁我的防线</text><text for="L45">如果你这么喜欢自己这副样子</text><text for="L46">哦 宝贝 你真该去爱自己</text><text for="L47">如果你还以为我放不下过去</text><text for="L48">你真该去爱自己</text><text for="L49">如果你这么喜欢自己这副样子</text><text for="L50">哦 宝贝 你真该去爱自己（耶）</text><text for="L51">如果你还以为我放不下过去 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(你还以为我放不下 哦)</span></text><text for="L52">你真该去爱自己</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Love Yourself"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Justin Bieber"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Purpose"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001tcKlc0yHWkc"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1319395226"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440826328"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71516761"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:00.572" end="0:38.563" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:00.572" end="0:04.486" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.572" end="0:00.706">For</span> <span begin="0:00.706" end="0:00.909">all</span> <span begin="0:00.909" end="0:01.122">the</span> <span begin="0:01.122" end="0:01.549">times</span> <span begin="0:01.549" end="0:01.882">that</span> <span begin="0:01.882" end="0:02.349">you</span> <span begin="0:02.349" end="0:02.750">rain</span> <span begin="0:02.750" end="0:03.008">on</span> <span begin="0:03.008" end="0:03.377">my</span> <span begin="0:03.377" end="0:04.486">parade</span></p><p begin="0:05.330" end="0:09.070" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.330" end="0:05.556">And</span> <span begin="0:05.556" end="0:05.748">all</span> <span begin="0:05.748" end="0:06.008">the</span> <span begin="0:06.008" end="0:06.406">clubs</span> <span begin="0:06.406" end="0:06.673">you</span> <span begin="0:06.673" end="0:06.939">get</span> <span begin="0:06.939" end="0:07.259">in</span> <span begin="0:07.259" end="0:07.899">using</span> <span begin="0:07.899" end="0:08.219">my</span> <span begin="0:08.219" end="0:09.070">name</span></p><p begin="0:10.104" end="0:14.262" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.104" end="0:10.310">You</span> <span begin="0:10.310" end="0:10.510">think</span> <span begin="0:10.510" end="0:10.777">you</span> <span begin="0:10.777" end="0:11.216">broke</span> <span begin="0:11.216" end="0:11.483">my</span> <span begin="0:11.483" end="0:11.765">heart,</span> <span begin="0:11.765" end="0:12.085">oh,</span> <span begin="0:12.085" end="0:12.405">girl,</span> <span begin="0:12.405" end="0:12.669">for</span> <span begin="0:12.669" end="0:13.606">goodness</span> <span begin="0:13.606" end="0:14.262">sake</span></p><p begin="0:14.944" end="0:18.694" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.944" end="0:15.123">You</span> <span begin="0:15.123" end="0:15.340">think</span> <span begin="0:15.340" end="0:15.579">I'm</span> <span begin="0:15.579" end="0:16.259">crying</span> <span begin="0:16.259" end="0:16.539">on</span> <span begin="0:16.539" end="0:16.859">my</span> <span begin="0:16.859" end="0:17.179">own,</span> <span begin="0:17.179" end="0:17.499">well,</span> <span begin="0:17.499" end="0:17.806">I</span> <span begin="0:17.806" end="0:18.694">ain't</span></p><p begin="0:19.657" end="0:21.904" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.657" end="0:19.792">And</span> <span begin="0:19.792" end="0:19.933">I</span> <span begin="0:19.933" end="0:20.210">didn't</span> <span begin="0:20.210" end="0:20.509">wanna</span> <span begin="0:20.509" end="0:20.882">write</span> <span begin="0:20.882" end="0:21.055">a</span> <span begin="0:21.055" end="0:21.904">song</span></p><p begin="0:21.998" end="0:26.486" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.998" end="0:22.170">'Cause</span> <span begin="0:22.170" end="0:22.320">I</span> <span begin="0:22.320" end="0:22.637">didn't</span> <span begin="0:22.637" end="0:22.931">want</span> <span begin="0:22.931" end="0:23.490">anyone</span> <span begin="0:23.490" end="0:24.105">thinking</span> <span begin="0:24.105" end="0:24.384">I</span> <span begin="0:24.384" end="0:24.691">still</span> <span begin="0:24.691" end="0:25.134">care,</span> <span begin="0:25.134" end="0:25.291">I</span> <span begin="0:25.291" end="0:25.931">don't</span> <span begin="0:25.931" end="0:26.486">but</span></p><p begin="0:26.518" end="0:28.918" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.518" end="0:26.777">You</span> <span begin="0:26.777" end="0:27.044">still</span> <span begin="0:27.044" end="0:27.323">hit</span> <span begin="0:27.323" end="0:27.671">my</span> <span begin="0:27.671" end="0:28.337">phone</span> <span begin="0:28.337" end="0:28.918">up</span></p><p begin="0:29.347" end="0:31.405" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.347" end="0:29.568">And</span> <span begin="0:29.568" end="0:29.768">baby,</span> <span begin="0:29.768" end="0:29.941">I'll</span> <span begin="0:29.941" end="0:30.129">be</span> <span begin="0:30.129" end="0:30.675">moving</span> <span begin="0:30.675" end="0:31.405">on</span></p><p begin="0:31.568" end="0:36.104" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.568" end="0:31.718">And</span> <span begin="0:31.718" end="0:31.893">I</span> <span begin="0:31.893" end="0:32.223">think</span> <span begin="0:32.223" end="0:32.415">you</span> <span begin="0:32.415" end="0:32.775">should</span> <span begin="0:32.775" end="0:32.983">be</span> <span begin="0:32.983" end="0:33.704">something</span> <span begin="0:33.704" end="0:33.971">I</span> <span begin="0:33.971" end="0:34.272">don't</span> <span begin="0:34.272" end="0:34.918">wanna</span> <span begin="0:34.918" end="0:35.505">hold</span> <span begin="0:35.505" end="0:36.104">back</span></p><p begin="0:36.118" end="0:38.563" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.118" end="0:36.725">Maybe</span> <span begin="0:36.725" end="0:36.995">you</span> <span begin="0:36.995" end="0:37.284">should</span> <span begin="0:37.284" end="0:37.883">know</span> <span begin="0:37.883" end="0:38.563">that</span></p></div><div begin="0:38.779" end="0:58.020" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="0:38.779" end="0:42.748" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.779" end="0:38.970">My</span> <span begin="0:38.970" end="0:39.351">mama</span> <span begin="0:39.351" end="0:39.711">don't</span> <span begin="0:39.711" end="0:40.237">like</span> <span begin="0:40.237" end="0:40.687">you</span> <span begin="0:40.687" end="0:40.926">and</span> <span begin="0:40.926" end="0:41.211">she</span> <span begin="0:41.211" end="0:41.626">likes</span> <span begin="0:41.626" end="0:42.048">every</span><span begin="0:42.048" end="0:42.748">one</span></p><p begin="0:43.599" end="0:47.547" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.599" end="0:43.821">And</span> <span begin="0:43.821" end="0:44.000">I</span> <span begin="0:44.000" end="0:44.435">never</span> <span begin="0:44.435" end="0:45.035">like</span> <span begin="0:45.035" end="0:45.530">to</span> <span begin="0:45.530" end="0:45.995">admit</span> <span begin="0:45.995" end="0:46.166">that</span> <span begin="0:46.166" end="0:46.305">I</span> <span begin="0:46.305" end="0:46.683">was</span> <span begin="0:46.683" end="0:47.547">wrong</span></p><p begin="0:48.230" end="0:51.083" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.230" end="0:48.483">And</span> <span begin="0:48.483" end="0:48.723">I've</span> <span begin="0:48.723" end="0:48.992">been</span> <span begin="0:48.992" end="0:49.239">so</span> <span begin="0:49.239" end="0:49.708">caught</span> <span begin="0:49.708" end="0:49.997">up</span> <span begin="0:49.997" end="0:50.187">in</span> <span begin="0:50.187" end="0:50.488">my</span> <span begin="0:50.488" end="0:51.083">job</span></p><p begin="0:51.095" end="0:53.339" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.095" end="0:51.655">Didn't</span> <span begin="0:51.655" end="0:52.044">see</span> <span begin="0:52.044" end="0:52.327">what's</span> <span begin="0:52.327" end="0:52.911">going</span> <span begin="0:52.911" end="0:53.339">on</span></p><p begin="0:53.349" end="0:54.658" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.349" end="0:53.520">But</span> <span begin="0:53.520" end="0:53.838">now</span> <span begin="0:53.838" end="0:54.103">I</span> <span begin="0:54.103" end="0:54.658">know</span></p><p begin="0:55.578" end="0:58.020" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.578" end="0:55.884">I'm</span> <span begin="0:55.884" end="0:56.530">better</span> <span begin="0:56.530" end="0:57.115">sleeping</span> <span begin="0:57.115" end="0:57.370">on</span> <span begin="0:57.370" end="0:57.684">my</span> <span begin="0:57.684" end="0:58.020">own</span></p></div><div begin="0:58.031" end="1:16.100" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:58.031" end="1:02.791" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.031" end="0:58.271">'Cause</span> <span begin="0:58.271" end="0:58.483">if</span> <span begin="0:58.483" end="0:58.867">you</span> <span begin="0:58.867" end="0:59.401">like</span> <span begin="0:59.799" end="1:00.099">the</span> <span begin="1:00.099" end="1:00.636">way</span> <span begin="1:00.984" end="1:01.270">you</span> <span begin="1:01.270" end="1:01.555">look</span> <span begin="1:01.555" end="1:02.155">that</span> <span begin="1:02.155" end="1:02.791">much</span></p><p begin="1:02.797" end="1:06.477" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.797" end="1:03.062">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:03.062" end="1:03.648">baby,</span> <span begin="1:03.648" end="1:03.882">you</span> <span begin="1:03.882" end="1:04.233">should</span> <span begin="1:04.233" end="1:04.515">go</span> <span begin="1:04.515" end="1:04.833">and</span> <span begin="1:04.833" end="1:05.158">love</span> <span begin="1:05.158" end="1:06.477">yourself</span></p><p begin="1:07.598" end="1:13.296" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.598" end="1:07.